24b9d8c-8955-5a21-ab47-bd79bfc2648c" "answer-17152414-1ddb-5e41-9abb-42921b68db62" "answer-860c6ce0-0936-5949-979e-21b5c6244968" "answer-5d1c0afa-44a7-534c-9aa8-dbc746816bd7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7b5ba170-762f-5afc-ac78-ade8780eeb8e" :answer/id #uuid "7b5ba170-762f-5afc-ac78-ade8780eeb8e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "15ab" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-724b9d8c-8955-5a21-ab47-bd79bfc2648c" :answer/id #uuid "724b9d8c-8955-5a21-ab47-bd79bfc2648c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt[3]{15ab}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-17152414-1ddb-5e41-9abb-42921b68db62" :answer/id #uuid "17152414-1ddb-5e41-9abb-42921b68db62" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt[3]{15a{b}^{2}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-860c6ce0-0936-5949-979e-21b5c6244968" :answer/id #uuid "860c6ce0-0936-5949-979e-21b5c6244968" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt[3]{3}ab" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5d1c0afa-44a7-534c-9aa8-dbc746816bd7" :answer/id #uuid "5d1c0afa-44a7-534c-9aa8-dbc746816bd7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt[3]{5}ab" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186188244 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-fa1ab2c6-2c4e-5cd2-a497-7648fbd76dfd"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-fa1ab2c6-2c4e-5cd2-a497-7648fbd76dfd" :question/id #uuid "fa1ab2c6-2c4e-5cd2-a497-7648fbd76dfd" :question/math-academy-id "q-215010" :question/problem "What is $0.9\\,\\text{g}$ expressed in $\\text{mg}?$ Write your answer as a whole number.\n\n$0.9\\,\\text{g}=$\n{{field-1}}$\\text{mg}$" :question/worked-solution "We start by recalling the conversion table for mass units. \n\n| Name | Symbol | Conversion |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Kilogram | $\\text{kg}$ | $1\\,\\text{kg}=1\\,000\\,\\text{g}$ |\n| Gram | $\\text{g}$ | Base Unit |\n| Milligram | $\\text{mg}$ | $1\\,000\\,\\text{mg}=1\\,\\text{g}$ |\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nThere are $1\\,000\\,\\text{mg}$ per $\\text{g},$ which we can write as follows:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1000\\,\\text{mg}}{\\text{g}}\n$$\n\nThis is our conversion factor.\n\nNow, multiplying $0.9\\,\\text{g}$ by our conversion factor, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}0.9\\,\\text{g} & =0.9\\,\\text{g}\\cdot \\frac{1\\,000\\,\\text{mg}}{\\text{g}} \\\\  & =0.9\\,\\cancel{\\text{g}}\\cdot \\frac{1\\,000\\,\\text{mg}}{\\cancel{\\text{g}}} \\\\  & =0.9\\cdot 1\\,000\\,\\text{mg} \\\\  & =900\\,\\text{mg}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $0.9\\,\\text{g}$ is equivalent to $900\\,\\text{mg}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-250a40f4-0b82-5e29-a71e-46fe4615e2b3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-250a40f4-0b82-5e29-a71e-46fe4615e2b3" :answer-field/id #uuid "250a40f4-0b82-5e29-a71e-46fe4615e2b3" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-98aaef27-e9c7-59f1-9e36-1b5d0f4406ec" :answer-field/choices ["answer-98aaef27-e9c7-59f1-9e36-1b5d0f4406ec"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-98aaef27-e9c7-59f1-9e36-1b5d0f4406ec" :answer/id #uuid "98aaef27-e9c7-59f1-9e36-1b5d0f4406ec" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "900" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186105740 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-0a6c019b-459a-54b3-94ee-3cfc489e4bfd"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-0a6c019b-459a-54b3-94ee-3cfc489e4bfd" :question/id #uuid "0a6c019b-459a-54b3-94ee-3cfc489e4bfd" :question/math-academy-id "q-171894" :question/problem "![](images/71/71434714d4941799da3859979b9a75950994efef09b523da00a6a11523e3b906.png)\n\nGiven that the triangle $△ABC$ shown above is isosceles, the measure of $\\overset{―}{AC}$ must be equal to{{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "Since $△ABC$ is an isosceles triangle with base $\\overset{―}{AB}$, we have that $\\overset{―}{AC}≅\\overset{―}{CB}.$ Hence,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =CB \\\\ 3x-9 & =2x-1 \\\\ x & =8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting this value into the expression for the measure of $\\overset{―}{AC}$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =3x-9 \\\\  & =3(8)-9 \\\\  & =15.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-b6d6b55c-d050-5c1b-be29-79f79339ccca"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-b6d6b55c-d050-5c1b-be29-79f79339ccca" :answer-field/id #uuid "b6d6b55c-d050-5c1b-be29-79f79339ccca" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-fa42a462-2d42-54bc-8d5b-f4b3a4b564dd" :answer-field/choices ["answer-fa42a462-2d42-54bc-8d5b-f4b3a4b564dd"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fa42a462-2d42-54bc-8d5b-f4b3a4b564dd" :answer/id #uuid "fa42a462-2d42-54bc-8d5b-f4b3a4b564dd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "15" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186138561 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-eaee2e36-f252-5a56-ba54-f7a90c1e698d"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-eaee2e36-f252-5a56-ba54-f7a90c1e698d" :question/id #uuid "eaee2e36-f252-5a56-ba54-f7a90c1e698d" :question/math-academy-id "q-25774" :question/problem "![](images/c1/c15de626535d55df85e756b8c3fffc9c4d50eb5b7e2b049eeec3f2ba6be2f2bb.png)\n\nIn the diagram shown above, $B$ is the midpoint of $\\overset{―}{AD}.$ Find $BC$ if $AD=29\\,\\text{cm}$ and $CD=6.5\\,\\text{cm}.$" :question/worked-solution "Since $B$ is the midpoint of $\\overset{―}{AD}$, we have: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}BD & =\\frac{1}{2}AD \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 29 \\\\  & =14.5\\,\\text{cm}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, by the segment addition postulate, we obtain: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}BD & =BC+CD \\\\ 14.5 & =BC+6.5 \\\\ 14.5-6.5 & =BC \\\\ BC & =8\\,\\text{cm}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-91ebac2f-a127-5374-8422-8d7547f89157"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-91ebac2f-a127-5374-8422-8d7547f89157" :answer-field/id #uuid "91ebac2f-a127-5374-8422-8d7547f89157" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-3b03ae89-2d6b-5a08-85ea-dff271502074" :answer-field/choices ["answer-d3b4ad2c-c9a8-5190-bed2-340447dd6089" "answer-6a531e71-3a1c-5a27-8860-874d97d930f4" "answer-e93f0823-8ac4-5346-b9c4-51ac8f993a71" "answer-3b03ae89-2d6b-5a08-85ea-dff271502074" "answer-51e545ac-5ebc-5ae2-b38d-b9f8d50d893e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d3b4ad2c-c9a8-5190-bed2-340447dd6089" :answer/id #uuid "d3b4ad2c-c9a8-5190-bed2-340447dd6089" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10\\,\\text{ cm}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-6a531e71-3a1c-5a27-8860-874d97d930f4" :answer/id #uuid "6a531e71-3a1c-5a27-8860-874d97d930f4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7.25\\,\\text{ cm}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e93f0823-8ac4-5346-b9c4-51ac8f993a71" :answer/id #uuid "e93f0823-8ac4-5346-b9c4-51ac8f993a71" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7.75\\,\\text{ cm}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3b03ae89-2d6b-5a08-85ea-dff271502074" :answer/id #uuid "3b03ae89-2d6b-5a08-85ea-dff271502074" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8\\,\\text{ cm}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-51e545ac-5ebc-5ae2-b38d-b9f8d50d893e" :answer/id #uuid "51e545ac-5ebc-5ae2-b38d-b9f8d50d893e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9\\,\\text{ cm}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186105871 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-0be768b0-d70e-57fe-9f86-a4cf5ff73d92"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-0be768b0-d70e-57fe-9f86-a4cf5ff73d92" :question/id #uuid "0be768b0-d70e-57fe-9f86-a4cf5ff73d92" :question/math-academy-id "q-87850" :question/problem "![](images/26/26ab73d81c0ec3ef9b2b6fa93de11266fb4d0629b875d7d38636f36926f0f053.png)\n\nWhat is the area of the right triangle $ABC$ shown above?" :question/worked-solution "Since $m∠A=m∠C={45}^{∘}$ and $AB=BC,$ we have an isosceles right triangle. \n\n![](images/e1/e13a301fe37d44657754877ef61b4d5e0e913c309784baa50d53f0d0e5edd913.png)\n\nTherefore, the area of the triangle is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =\\frac{1}{2}AB\\cdot BC \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot {8}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 64 \\\\  & =32.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-df003f1c-da11-5c20-b29c-290f8d22c7d1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-df003f1c-da11-5c20-b29c-290f8d22c7d1" :answer-field/id #uuid "df003f1c-da11-5c20-b29c-290f8d22c7d1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-56882461-c4a1-56bb-a01a-69f712e09d6b" :answer-field/choices ["answer-d36d18ae-4508-5fcf-b6f7-e6dc10f0092c" "answer-01f7147e-291e-51e1-814e-204d4b837970" "answer-56882461-c4a1-56bb-a01a-69f712e09d6b" "answer-e3a9e524-d6ab-5b23-ac28-b9ac7ddfb943" "answer-c8d8b9cf-6230-5853-9eba-97871d5940a2"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d36d18ae-4508-5fcf-b6f7-e6dc10f0092c" :answer/id #uuid "d36d18ae-4508-5fcf-b6f7-e6dc10f0092c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "128" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-01f7147e-291e-51e1-814e-204d4b837970" :answer/id #uuid "01f7147e-291e-51e1-814e-204d4b837970" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "16" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-56882461-c4a1-56bb-a01a-69f712e09d6b" :answer/id #uuid "56882461-c4a1-56bb-a01a-69f712e09d6b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "32" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e3a9e524-d6ab-5b23-ac28-b9ac7ddfb943" :answer/id #uuid "e3a9e524-d6ab-5b23-ac28-b9ac7ddfb943" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "64" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c8d8b9cf-6230-5853-9eba-97871d5940a2" :answer/id #uuid "c8d8b9cf-6230-5853-9eba-97871d5940a2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "96" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186138511 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-64689025-90b1-5416-8d71-9bc463abeb1c"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-64689025-90b1-5416-8d71-9bc463abeb1c" :question/id #uuid "64689025-90b1-5416-8d71-9bc463abeb1c" :question/math-academy-id "q-175584" :question/problem "$\\frac{7}{2}u+4w-\\frac{2}{3}u-w=${{field-1}}\n$u\\,+$\n{{field-2}}\n$w$" :question/worked-solution "We collect and combine the like terms, simplifying the coefficients as much as possible:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2}u+4w-\\frac{2}{3}u-w & = \\\\ (\\frac{7}{2}u-\\frac{2}{3}u)+(4w-w) & = \\\\ (\\frac{7}{2}-\\frac{2}{3})u+(4-1)w & = \\\\ (\\frac{21}{6}-\\frac{4}{6})u+3w & = \\\\ (\\frac{21-4}{6})u+3w & = \\\\ \\frac{17}{6}\\,u+3\\,w\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-54dab796-cb41-55f7-82f8-49c26b926e11" "answer-field-4a8fb50b-f581-55fc-8b2e-6ae22914031e"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-54dab796-cb41-55f7-82f8-49c26b926e11" :answer-field/id #uuid "54dab796-cb41-55f7-82f8-49c26b926e11" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-72d3c220-e470-557e-bcd0-a9f8849b3dc9" :answer-field/choices ["answer-72d3c220-e470-557e-bcd0-a9f8849b3dc9"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-72d3c220-e470-557e-bcd0-a9f8849b3dc9" :answer/id #uuid "72d3c220-e470-557e-bcd0-a9f8849b3dc9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{17}{6}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-4a8fb50b-f581-55fc-8b2e-6ae22914031e" :answer-field/id #uuid "4a8fb50b-f581-55fc-8b2e-6ae22914031e" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-880a7533-d27a-5209-9676-048622c816b1" :answer-field/choices ["answer-880a7533-d27a-5209-9676-048622c816b