| $\\text{F}$ | {{field-4}} |" :question/worked-solution "According to the definition of the biconditional, \n\n- $P⇔Q$ is true if $P⇒Q$ **and** $Q⇒P.$ Otherwise, it is false.\n\n- In other words, $P⇔Q$ is true if $P$ and $Q$ have the same truth values. Otherwise, it is false.\n\nFirst, we add columns for $¬B,$ $A∧¬B,$ and $A∨B:$\n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,¬B\\,$ | $\\,A∧¬B\\,$ | $\\,A∨B\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n\nFinally, we add a column for $(A∧¬B)⇔(A∨B).$ \n\n| $\\,A\\,$ | $\\,B\\,$ | $\\,¬B\\,$ | $\\,A∧¬B\\,$ | $\\,A∨B\\,$ | $\\,(A∧¬B)⇔(A∨B)\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{T}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ |\n| $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{F}$ | $\\text{T}$ |" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-8f01d81d-a22d-58cc-b3b7-9619034e42ed" "answer-field-c7577480-6527-59fa-b4ba-4bcdcce2de64" "answer-field-d3414835-0ffe-530b-a13f-b7427f650c20" "answer-field-f469b983-4520-5eeb-a4dd-2be04a9bfbf3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-8f01d81d-a22d-58cc-b3b7-9619034e42ed" :answer-field/id #uuid "8f01d81d-a22d-58cc-b3b7-9619034e42ed" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-51aec534-6111-5aa9-bc65-f0397043fa51" :answer-field/choices ["answer-51aec534-6111-5aa9-bc65-f0397043fa51" "answer-e219fbda-dbcb-529d-84fe-b2d63467dad6"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "an